  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4666,
      "text": "How many nations We destroyed before these [Makkans] who were stronger than them in might! They sought refuge in the land. Did they find any escape?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 520,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4667,
      "text": "Indeed, in that is a reminder for anyone who has a [mindful] heart or lends an attentive ear.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 520,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4668,
      "text": "Indeed, We created the heavens and earth and all that is between them in six days, and no weariness touched Us[17].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 520,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4669,
      "text": "So bear patiently [O Prophet] what they say, and glorify the praise of your Lord before sunrise and before sunset[18].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 520,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4670,
      "text": "And glorify Him in the night[19] and after the prayers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 520,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4671,
      "text": "And listen! On the Day when the Caller will call out from a nearby place[20],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 520,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4672,
      "text": "the Day when they will hear the Blast [of the second Trumpet] in truth[21]. That is the Day of Resurrection.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 520,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4673,
      "text": "Indeed, it is We Who give life and cause death, and to Us is the final return.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 520,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4674,
      "text": "On the Day when the earth will be rent asunder for them as they hasten forth [from their graves]; that is an easy gathering for Us.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 520,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4675,
      "text": "We know best what they say, and you are not there to compel them to believe. But remind with the Qur’an those who fear My warning.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 520,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4676,
      "text": "By the winds that scatter [dust],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 51,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الذَّارِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Adh-Dhaariyat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Winnowing Winds",
